part|the stream's decode|the columns' room and the labels|tier0_push_entries
part|the stream's decode|the columns' room and the labels|tier0_vector_labels
part|the stream's decode|the columns' room and the labels|tier0_label_entries
part|the stream's decode|the columns' room and the labels|tier0_compile_segments
part|the stream's decode|the columns' room and the labels|tier0_segments_strip
part|the stream's decode|the values' predicates (P0)|tier0_vector_values
part|the stream's decode|the depths (P4)|tier0_vector_depths
part|the stream's decode|the depths (P4)|tier0_vector_mask_depths
part|the stream's decode|the depths (P4)|tier0_wide_depths_vector

